OL,3,GNEWSATraders count cost of extended
OL,4,Acongestion charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FSmall businesses are being "sacrificed"
OL,7,Fwhile a council earns extra money from
OL,8,Fa prolonged congestion charge scheme,
OL,9,Ftraders have said.
OL,11,FThe temporary scheme introduced charges
OL,12,Ffor vehicles entering Oxford city
OL,13,Fcentre from October 2025 and has been
OL,14,Fextended until 28 September.
OL,16,FOriginally forecast to raise #3.2m, the
OL,17,Fscheme is now expected to generate a
OL,18,F#7.7m surplus, the Local Democracy
OL,19,FReporting Service has learned.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
