OL,3,GNEWSATraders count cost of extended
OL,4,Acongestion charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FOxford Business Action Group (OBAG)
OL,7,Fsaid "turnover fell off a cliff" when
OL,8,Fthe charge was introduced. However,
OL,9,FOxfordshire County Council said the
OL,10,Fscheme had delivered faster journeys,
OL,11,Fcleaner air, reduced traffic and safer
OL,12,Fstreets.
